      "why": "RUK-290 §4. Three of this endpoint's four interesting shapes are failures, and an invented failure envelope records the author's belief about the backend rather than the backend. The path moved to /notify/email/test in b74a4536 (RUK-304); the recorded bodies are unchanged, because the route moved and the envelopes did not.",
