      "handEditedReason": "scripts/refresh-fixtures.mjs issues GET only and refuses non-2xx, so it cannot capture a POST whose success is an empty 204 and whose useful shapes are error envelopes. Taken off the wire by hand against a locally built backend (main @ a814a01) and recorded verbatim, except the resolver IP inside probe_failed.message, masked as <IP> because no-pii.test.ts refuses a committed fixture carrying a raw IPv4 — the file documents that substitution in its own _masked field."
    },
